{"text": "From: Squier, Sidonie, HSD\n\nTo: Keith Gardner\nSubject: FW: letter of resignation\nDate: Wednesday, March 21, 2012 8:16:00 AM\nAttachments: Derksen_Resignation.pdf\nnone Original Message-----\n\nFrom: Derksen, Dan, HSD\nSent: Monday, March 19, 2012 7:42 PM\nTo: Squier, Sidonie, HSD\nSubject: letter of resignation\n\nSidonie -\nThe first attachment was the letter I sent to the Governor via Keith. This one is to you. I have discussed this with\nthe staff, and turned in my key and badge. Per our conversation, I will not return to the office, but be available by\nemail or phone if you need anything further.\n\nTake care,\n\nDan",
